[{"step_title": "Uninstall nas4webtrees", "items": [{"desc": "This removes the container, the image and the folder <code>docker/__PKG__</code> with the webtrees program and database.<br><br><b>Your backup is kept:</b> the folder <code>__BACKUP_SUBDIR__</code> in the shared folder chosen in the wizard (default: <code>__DEFAULT_SHARE__</code>) holds every family tree as a GEDCOM file, the database with all accounts and the photos — as of last night. To be completely safe, run a fresh GEDCOM export in webtrees first.<br><br>Reinstalling later with “Restore from an existing backup” takes over the latest state."}]}]